# Findings Ledger

What <PROJECT NAME> currently believes, one numbered finding per line-item,
each backed by an experiment. **Grep this file before designing any new
experiment** — the direction may already be settled, or already a dead end.

> **For agents**: distill 1–5 findings per concluded experiment via
> `scripts/log-finding.py`. Never delete a finding — overturned ones move
> to `## Overturned` with strikethrough (`--overturns` handles this).
> Statements must be quantified, decision-relevant, and carry their
> `(#NNN)` evidence ref. See the skill's `references/ledger-format.md`.

